    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Please Note:</strong></i><br><i> Blue Maiden is a slow-paced walking simulator that focuses on atmosphere, exploration, and puzzle-solving. It is <strong>not</strong> an action-heavy horror game and does <strong>not</strong> feature combat or fast-paced gameplay. If you're looking for adrenaline-fueled horror, this may not be the experience for you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/1e89b889a144c6c1dd987c232becb270.poster.avif?t=1753155830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/1e89b889a144c6c1dd987c232becb270.webm?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/1e89b889a144c6c1dd987c232becb270.mp4?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blue Maiden</i> is a Japanese first-person psychological horror game where the terror creeps in slowly and subtly. As Tachi Tachibana, a recent university graduate, you return to your childhood neighborhood to help with the family business\u2014only to find the streets eerily empty and the air thick with dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been haunted by the same nightmare over and over: a mysterious girl standing silently beneath a cherry tree. But when the dreams start blending into your waking life, you realize that something is terribly wrong. Step into the heart of a decaying town and uncover the truth behind the legend of the <strong>Blue Maiden</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong><br> Take your time to explore eerie, traditional Japanese locations brought to life with atmospheric visuals and immersive sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong><br> The game builds dread through story and setting, featuring light jumpscares and disturbing imagery designed to unnerve rather than shock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/55331f0fdde6dcc55d15d27871b12563.poster.avif?t=1753155830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/55331f0fdde6dcc55d15d27871b12563.webm?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/55331f0fdde6dcc55d15d27871b12563.mp4?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong><br> Search for clues, solve environmental puzzles, and piece together the mystery of the Blue Maiden through subtle narrative details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong><br> A complete playthrough takes about 1 hour, with roughly 30 minutes of extra content available for players who seek out all 3 endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Japanese Setting:</strong><br> Inspired by classic Japanese horror, Blue Maiden blends folklore, melancholy, and mystery into a uniquely haunting experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/4cf296e9f1fc05e489e07abe37a25e38.poster.avif?t=1753155830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/4cf296e9f1fc05e489e07abe37a25e38.webm?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/4cf296e9f1fc05e489e07abe37a25e38.mp4?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Can you uncover the truth behind the Blue Maiden?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step quietly. Look closely. Not everything wants to be found.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Please Note:</strong></i><br><i> Blue Maiden is a slow-paced walking simulator that focuses on atmosphere, exploration, and puzzle-solving. It is <strong>not</strong> an action-heavy horror game and does <strong>not</strong> feature combat or fast-paced gameplay. If you're looking for adrenaline-fueled horror, this may not be the experience for you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/1e89b889a144c6c1dd987c232becb270.poster.avif?t=1753155830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/1e89b889a144c6c1dd987c232becb270.webm?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/1e89b889a144c6c1dd987c232becb270.mp4?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blue Maiden</i> is a Japanese first-person psychological horror game where the terror creeps in slowly and subtly. As Tachi Tachibana, a recent university graduate, you return to your childhood neighborhood to help with the family business\u2014only to find the streets eerily empty and the air thick with dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been haunted by the same nightmare over and over: a mysterious girl standing silently beneath a cherry tree. But when the dreams start blending into your waking life, you realize that something is terribly wrong. Step into the heart of a decaying town and uncover the truth behind the legend of the <strong>Blue Maiden</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong><br> Take your time to explore eerie, traditional Japanese locations brought to life with atmospheric visuals and immersive sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong><br> The game builds dread through story and setting, featuring light jumpscares and disturbing imagery designed to unnerve rather than shock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/55331f0fdde6dcc55d15d27871b12563.poster.avif?t=1753155830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/55331f0fdde6dcc55d15d27871b12563.webm?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/55331f0fdde6dcc55d15d27871b12563.mp4?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong><br> Search for clues, solve environmental puzzles, and piece together the mystery of the Blue Maiden through subtle narrative details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong><br> A complete playthrough takes about 1 hour, with roughly 30 minutes of extra content available for players who seek out all 3 endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Japanese Setting:</strong><br> Inspired by classic Japanese horror, Blue Maiden blends folklore, melancholy, and mystery into a uniquely haunting experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/4cf296e9f1fc05e489e07abe37a25e38.poster.avif?t=1753155830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/4cf296e9f1fc05e489e07abe37a25e38.webm?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391690/extras/4cf296e9f1fc05e489e07abe37a25e38.mp4?t=1753155830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Can you uncover the truth behind the Blue Maiden?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step quietly. Look closely. Not everything wants to be found.</p>",
